{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/directvideo/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/directvideo/", "title": "Direct Video Adapter", "content_html": "<h2>Direct Video</h2>\n<p>Since autumn 2019, <em>Direct Video</em> has provided analog video output without an I/O board. It offers minimal latency comparable to the I/O boar...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/directvideo.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T14:45:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/directvideo/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/directvideo/", "title": "Direct Video\u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc", "content_html": "<h2>Direct Video</h2>\n<p>2019\u5e74\u79cb\u4ee5\u964d\u3001<em>Direct Video</em> \u306f I/O \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3057\u3067\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u6620\u50cf\u51fa\u529b\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u3066\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002I/O \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306e VGA \u51fa\u529b\u306b\u5339\u6575\u3059\u308b\u6700\u5c0f\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f7f\u3046\u306b\u306f <code>MiSTer.ini</code> \u3067 Direct Video \u3092\u6709\u52b9\u306b\u3057\u3001\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u306e\u3042\u308b HDMI-t...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/directvideo.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T14:45:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crttable/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crttable/", "title": "CRT Configuration Table", "content_html": "<p>This table shows the <code>MiSTer.ini</code> settings required for each analog video output mode when connecting to a CRT.</p>\n<h2>CRT Configuration Table</h2>\n<p>| Analog Video O...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crttable.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "title": "Addon Boards", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "title": "Controllers", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer supports a wide variety of input devices. It also offers options for configuring them and several quality-of-life features that work in most (sometime...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core is the most feature-filled and heavily developed core so far:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region s...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crttable/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crttable/", "title": "CRT\u8a2d\u5b9a\u8868", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u8868\u306f\u3001CRT \u306b\u63a5\u7d9a\u3059\u308b\u969b\u306e\u5404\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u6620\u50cf\u51fa\u529b\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u5fc5\u8981\u306a <code>MiSTer.ini</code> \u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u793a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>CRT \u8a2d\u5b9a\u8868</h2>\n<p>| Analog Video Out     | composite_sync= | vga_mode= | vga_sog= | direct_video= | vga_sca...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crttable.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/addons/", "title": "\u62e1\u5f35\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u591a\u7a2e\u591a\u69d8\u306a\u5165\u529b\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3084\u3001\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306e\uff08\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u306f\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\uff09\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u4fbf\u5229\u6a5f\u80fd\u3082\u5099\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30d4\u30ca\u30fc\u30fb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d1\u30c3\u30c9\u30fb\u30b8\u30e7\u30a4\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u30fb\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u6a5f\u5668\u306e\u7279\u6b8a\u306a\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u3069\u3093\u306a\u6a5f\u5668\u304c\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\uff1f</h2>\n<p>\u57fa\u672c\u7684\u306b\u3001\u901a\u5e38\u306e USB HID \u4e92\u63db\u5165\u529b\u6a5f...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>Sony PlayStation\uff08PSX\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u3053\u308c\u307e\u3067\u3067\u6700\u3082\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u5145\u5b9f\u3057\u3001\u958b\u767a\u3082\u6d3b\u767a\u306a\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u3059\uff1a</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u8c4a\u5bcc\u306a\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3</li>\n<li>BIOS \u30ea\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u81ea\u52d5\u5207\u308a\u66ff\u3048</li>\n<li>\u624b\u52d5\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u305f\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc\u30c92\u30b9\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8</li>\n<li>\u9ad8\u901f\u5316\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9</li>\n<li>\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u5185\u30c6\u30af\u30b9\u30c1\u30e3\u5909\u66f4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PSX ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crt/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crt/", "title": "Using Your CRT With MiSTer", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer has two native analog output paths: VGA output from an I/O board, or Direct Video through a compatible HDMI-to-VGA adapter connected to the DE10-Nano'...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crt.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:28:36+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "Core Default Resolutions", "content_html": "<p>This chart shows each core's default native resolution, frequencies, and pixel clock at startup. These values are not static and are documented for reference...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:28:36+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crt/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crt/", "title": "CRT\u3092MiSTer\u3067\u4f7f\u3046", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u306f2\u3064\u306e\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u51fa\u529b\u7d4c\u8def\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002I/O \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u304b\u3089\u306e VGA \u51fa\u529b\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306f DE10-Nano \u306e HDMI \u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u63a5\u7d9a\u3057\u305f\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u306e\u3042\u308b HDMI-to-VGA \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc\u7d4c\u7531\u306e Direct Video \u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>*\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f MiSTer FPGA GitHub Wiki \u3067...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crt.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:28:36+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u8868\u306f\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u8d77\u52d5\u6642\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u30fb\u5468\u6ce2\u6570\u30fb\u30d4\u30af\u30bb\u30eb\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u793a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u5024\u306f\u56fa\u5b9a\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u3042\u304f\u307e\u3067\u53c2\u8003\u3068\u3057\u3066\u6587\u66f8\u5316\u3055\u308c\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002\u304a\u4f7f\u3044\u306e\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6</h2>\n<p>| \u30b3\u30a2             | \u30d0\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3 | ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:28:36+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/paths/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/paths/", "title": "Core Paths", "content_html": "<p>Each core looks for its games in a folder named after the core. This page lists where that folder can be, and which location is used if it exists in more tha...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/paths.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>The Sega Saturn MiSTer core, originally developed by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank}, is a suitable modern replac...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>The Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) MiSTer core has many features, such as CPU and Super FX turbo modes, lightgun and mouse support, and a configu...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "title": "TurboGrafx-16", "content_html": "<p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/TurboGrafx16_MiSTer\">MiSTer TurboGrafx16 core</a>{target=_blank} is an extremely accurate TurboGrafx-16 / PC-Engine impleme...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/tgfx16.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/paths/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/paths/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30d1\u30b9", "content_html": "<p>\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u30b3\u30a2\u540d\u3068\u540c\u3058\u540d\u524d\u306e\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u30fc\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u63a2\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u305d\u306e\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u30fc\u3092\u7f6e\u3051\u308b\u5834\u6240\u3068\u3001\u8907\u6570\u5b58\u5728\u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3069\u3061\u3089\u304c\u4f7f\u308f\u308c\u308b\u304b\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u6a19\u6e96\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u30d1\u30b9</h2>\n<p><code>/media/fat/games/&lt;CORE&gt;</code> \u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u3059\u3002<code>&lt;CORE&gt;</code> \u306f\u305d\u306e\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u306e[\u5185\u90e8\u30b3\u30a2\u540d](../develo...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/paths.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>Sega Saturn \u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank} \u6c0f\u304c\u958b\u767a\u3092\u59cb\u3081\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3001Sega Saturn \u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc\u306e\u5927\u591a\u6570\u306b\u304a\u3044\u3066\u5b9f\u6a5f\u306b\u4ee3\u308f\u308b\u73fe\u4ee3\u7684\u306a\u9078\u629e\u80a2\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}